  "statement": "In the expression \\(\\dfrac{x+1}{x-1},\\) each \\(x\\) is replaced by \\(\\dfrac{x+1}{x-1}.\\) The resulting expression, evaluated for \\(x=\\dfrac12,\\) equals:",
